name:Litaniae Lauretanae B. M. V.: Speculum justitiae ... Auxilium Christianorum, ora pro nobis;
office-part:Litaniae;
mode:6;
book:Processionarium O.P. (Cormier), 1913, pp. 92-93;
transcriber:set for this site from the scan of the Processionarium O.P. 1913;
commentary:set to the formula printed on pp. 92-93 (Speculum justitiae, ora pro nobis), every invocation as the book lines its syllables up under those notes: recitation on A (la, h), the last accent on B flat, the syllables after it on G;
